// Minimal ESP32-C3 platform.  Renode 1.17 has no TIMG; Arm_CMSDK_Timer at the
// TIMG T0 base provides the same offsets used by the example for CTRL, VALUE
// (T0LO), and RELOAD (T0HI).  GPIO output is backed by MappedMemory because
// Renode exposes no ESP32 GPIO port model.  The CoreLevelInterruptor at the
// ESP32-C3 CLINT base supplies machine timer interrupts for `#[interrupt]`
// handlers, wired to mcause 3 (software) and 7 (timer).
//
// UART0, GP-SPI2, and I2C are repository models (renode/models/*.cs, loaded
// by `@MODELS@` in the monitor script): Renode's ESP32_UART raises no receive
// interrupt and Renode ships no ESP32-C3 SPI or I2C controller.  On silicon
// the interrupt matrix maps each source to a CPU interrupt; `lusa::hal`
// programs it to CPU interrupt 11, and here the three lines are OR-ed onto
// the CPU's external interrupt (mcause 11, `machine_external`).  The matrix,
// SYSTEM clock gates, and IO MUX are plain memory.  SPI2 drives a MISO/MOSI
// loopback and I2C an echo device at 0x55 for the `lusa::hal` tests.
flash: Memory.MappedMemory @ sysbus 0x42000000
    size: 0x400000

sram: Memory.MappedMemory @ sysbus 0x3FC80000
    size: 0x64000

gpio: Memory.MappedMemory @ sysbus 0x60004000
    size: 0x1000

ioMux: Memory.MappedMemory @ sysbus 0x60009000
    size: 0x1000

system: Memory.MappedMemory @ sysbus 0x600C0000
    size: 0x1000

interruptMatrix: Memory.MappedMemory @ sysbus 0x600C2000
    size: 0x1000

externalIRQ: Miscellaneous.CombinedInput @ none
    numberOfInputs: 3
    -> cpu@11

uart0: UART.LusaEsp32C3Uart @ sysbus 0x60000000
    -> externalIRQ@0

spi2: SPI.LusaEsp32C3Spi @ sysbus 0x60024000
    -> externalIRQ@1

spiLoopback: SPI.SPILoopback @ spi2

i2c0: I2C.LusaEsp32C3I2c @ sysbus 0x60013000
    -> externalIRQ@2

i2cEcho: Mocks.EchoI2CDevice @ i2c0 0x55

timer0: Timers.Arm_CMSDK_Timer @ sysbus 0x6001F000
    frequency: 16000000

clint: IRQControllers.CoreLevelInterruptor @ sysbus 0x20008000
    [0, 1] -> cpu@[3, 7]
    frequency: 16000000

cpu: CPU.RiscV32 @ sysbus
    cpuType: "rv32imc_zicsr"
    privilegedArchitecture: PrivilegedArchitecture.Priv1_10
    timeProvider: clint
    hartId: 0
